{"version":1,"content":"<p>【勁啊 😂】開源專案團隊 ArtCraft 重構了 Adobe、Microsoft 合共 10 款軟體後，今日再追加 SoundCraft 與 CADCraft 套件，令 Craft App 軟體陣容增至 12 款。</p><p>該團隊強調所有工具均為開源、免費且支援原生跨平台執行，同時具備 AI 代理（AI Agents）自動化整合能力，協助全球用家擺脫雲端訂閱束縛。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T12:59:07.716001+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T12:46:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T13:57:42.366758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T12:57:39.423283+00:00","content_hash":"0f6fa64cde41a71e4428f15d32292125e35e57961f4c6c1c60ac78e749a376eb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}